      "text": "Vulnerabilities\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[36,22,38]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-vulnerabilities:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "A monster who is vulnerable to a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[36,38,71]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-vulnerabilities:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "substance loses 2 Life if exposed to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[36,71,108]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-vulnerabilities:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "it. The effect is automatic unless the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[36,108,147]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-vulnerabilities:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "monster’s description says\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[36,147,174]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-vulnerabilities:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "otherwise. You spend 1 action to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[36,174,207]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-vulnerabilities:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "use the object or substance that\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[36,207,240]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-vulnerabilities:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "triggers the creature’s vulnerability.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[36,240,279]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-vulnerabilities:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Some undead and demons, for\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[36,279,307]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-vulnerabilities:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "example, are vulnerable to holy\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[36,307,339]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-vulnerabilities:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "water. You spend 1 action and use\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[36,339,373]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-vulnerabilities:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "one vial of holy water to inflict 2\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[36,373,409]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-vulnerabilities:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "damage to the target.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[36,409,431]]"
    }
